# NOTE: vercel.json is intentionally tracked (see repo root) so Vercel picks
# up "buildCommand": "npm run build:vercel" without needing a Dashboard
# override. `npm run build:vercel` itself rewrites this file's contents to
# just `{"runtime":"nodejs20.x"}` as a build-time side effect (see
# node_modules/nukejs/dist/build-vercel.js) — that's expected and only
# affects your local working copy after a local build; don't commit that
# overwritten version, or `buildCommand` will be lost for the next deploy.
